In triangle $DEF$, $DE = 8$, $EF = 6$, and $FD = 10$.

[asy]
defaultpen(1);

pair D=(0,0), E=(0,6), F=(8,0);
draw(D--E--F--cycle);

label("\(D\)",D,SW);
label("\(E\)",E,N);
label("\(F\)",F,SE);

