(Ⅱ) How many years should this harvester be used to maximize the average profit? (Profit = Income - Maintenance cost - Cost of machinery)

An octagon $ABCDEFGH$ is divided into eight smaller equilateral triangles, such as $\triangle ABJ$ (where $J$ is the center of the octagon), shown in boldface in the diagram. By connecting every third vertex, we obtain a larger equilateral triangle $\triangle ADE$, which is also shown in boldface. Compute the ratio $[\triangle ABJ]/[\triangle ADE]$. 
